1
00:02:10,276 --> 00:02:12,276


2
00:02:20,170 --> 00:02:22,560
If I put my mind to it, I can do it too.

3
00:02:22,904 --> 00:02:25,160
Until now, I've been weak and cowardly.

4
00:02:26,274 --> 00:02:29,080
Alright, I have courage too!

5
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:32,580
Dr. Uranai, tonight is the night—I have made up my mind.

6
00:02:32,924 --> 00:02:35,800
Tomorrow, I will make an announcement that will shock everyone.

7
00:02:37,740 --> 00:02:40,580
Doctor, look forward to tomorrow.

8
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:44,800
But Your Majesty, that... what on earth is this?

9
00:02:45,214 --> 00:02:46,214
It's a secret.

10
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:49,500
So, Doctor, please leave me alone.

11
00:02:50,303 --> 00:02:51,693
Well then...

12
00:03:14,460 --> 00:03:16,582
As of today, I am changing the law of Silverland

13
00:03:16,606 --> 00:03:18,740
that forbids women from taking the throne.

14
00:03:19,026 --> 00:03:21,382
In the name of the King, I hereby decree

15
00:03:21,406 --> 00:03:23,966
that a woman may become Queen and rule this land.

16
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:30,140
There we go.

17
00:03:31,740 --> 00:03:32,740
Ah, perfect.

18
00:03:32,920 --> 00:03:35,880
Starting with this, I will change all the bad laws one after another.

19
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,113
I can't take much more of this...

20
00:03:49,610 --> 00:03:50,610
What are you doing?

21
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:51,800
What are you saying?

22
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:06,880
Your Highness!

23
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
Your Highness!

24
00:04:08,064 --> 00:04:09,400
This is terrible!

25
00:04:09,964 --> 00:04:11,959
The King is missing!

26
00:04:12,047 --> 00:04:12,761
What?!

27
00:04:12,785 --> 00:04:16,179
He hasn't been seen anywhere since this morning.

28
00:04:16,820 --> 00:04:17,820
Where is Mother?

29
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:18,613
Where is everyone?

30
00:04:18,670 --> 00:04:20,420
They're frantically searching everywhere.

31
00:04:20,975 --> 00:04:23,748
Your Majesty!

32
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,306
Your Majesty!

33
00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:28,873
Your Majesty!

34
00:04:28,980 --> 00:04:31,313
Your Majesty!

35
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:35,986
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

36
00:04:36,020 --> 00:04:39,720
Search every nook and cranny again—once, twice, three times!

37
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:41,016
Thoroughly, search thoroughly!

38
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:42,456
Your Majesty!

39
00:04:43,730 --> 00:04:45,589
Father!

40
00:04:45,614 --> 00:04:46,620
Your Majesty!

41
00:04:46,960 --> 00:04:47,960
Your Majesty!

42
00:04:48,465 --> 00:04:49,924
Your Majesty!

43
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:51,340
Your Highness!

44
00:04:51,455 --> 00:04:54,686
We searched the castle from top to bottom, but he's nowhere to be found.

45
00:04:54,725 --> 00:04:56,120
Check inside the moat, too!

46
00:04:56,210 --> 00:04:57,583
Right away!

47
00:05:00,660 --> 00:05:04,900
My Queen, the King was up writing something alone all night.

48
00:05:05,145 --> 00:05:07,353
Oh, if something happened to him...

49
00:05:07,501 --> 00:05:09,501
I'll go search again!

50
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,020
The family must be so worried.

51
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:18,200
Still, for the King to just vanish is truly bizarre.

52
00:05:18,325 --> 00:05:19,720
Keep your mouth shut!

53
00:05:19,905 --> 00:05:21,460
We shall search as well.

54
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,286
Command us as you will.

55
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:27,413
Father!

56
00:05:28,141 --> 00:05:31,534
Father!

57
00:05:32,327 --> 00:05:34,327
Father! Where are you?!

58
00:05:34,657 --> 00:05:37,104
Father!

59
00:05:40,467 --> 00:05:41,480
He's not in here, either.

60
00:05:41,805 --> 00:05:43,040
Ah, the armor!

61
00:05:45,516 --> 00:05:49,010
Father!

62
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:53,179
Father!

63
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:57,140
Even in the ancestral tombs... but...

64
00:06:00,660 --> 00:06:04,199
Father!

65
00:06:07,003 --> 00:06:09,876
Father!

66
00:06:10,343 --> 00:06:12,736
Father!

67
00:06:17,190 --> 00:06:18,260
I heard something!

68
00:06:19,933 --> 00:06:21,166
Father!

69
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:22,940
Was it just my imagination?

70
00:06:24,330 --> 00:06:28,480
My Prince, someone spotted a figure resembling the King early this morning.

71
00:06:30,003 --> 00:06:30,869
Where?

72
00:06:31,300 --> 00:06:32,960
Over by the Northern Valley.

73
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:35,400
Alright, I'll go check!

74
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,820
Opal, head to the Northern Valley!

75
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:17,413
Opal!

76
00:07:18,856 --> 00:07:19,440
Father!

77
00:07:19,464 --> 00:07:20,190
What's wrong?

78
00:07:20,660 --> 00:07:21,220
What is it?

79
00:07:26,230 --> 00:07:27,700
It looks like Father's shoe.

80
00:07:27,965 --> 00:07:30,060
Opal, hold the end of this rope in your mouth.

81
00:07:30,170 --> 00:07:31,170
I'm going down.

82
00:07:52,410 --> 00:07:53,703
What's wrong?

83
00:07:56,314 --> 00:07:57,741
OPAL!

84
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:26,653
It's Father's shoe!

85
00:08:33,239 --> 00:08:35,106
Oh, my darling!

86
00:08:42,549 --> 00:08:45,100
My deepest condolences.

87
00:08:46,493 --> 00:08:47,346
Mother!

88
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,740
Father?!

89
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:59,813
What happened?

90
00:09:32,249 --> 00:09:32,983
Your Grace,

91
00:09:33,007 --> 00:09:38,120
one week after the King's passing, the Prince will succeed to the throne.

92
00:09:38,345 --> 00:09:40,580
Prince Sapphire's coronation, is it?

93
00:09:40,820 --> 00:09:43,343
If our scheme goes smoothly by then...

94
00:09:43,367 --> 00:09:45,820
it should be quite an interesting coronation!

95
00:09:47,499 --> 00:09:49,046
You fool, Nylon!

96
00:10:18,669 --> 00:10:20,180
Sapphire, it's me.

97
00:10:20,520 --> 00:10:21,660
Come in, Mother.

98
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:24,580
Mother.

99
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:25,960
How do I look?

100
00:10:26,030 --> 00:10:27,640
You look beautiful, Sapphire.

101
00:10:29,490 --> 00:10:31,180
You thought I was crying, didn't you?

102
00:10:31,405 --> 00:10:33,500
Yes, I came to comfort you.

103
00:10:34,395 --> 00:10:35,920
I'm not going to cry anymore.

104
00:10:36,485 --> 00:10:37,980
Instead of crying, I decided to dress up.

105
00:10:38,620 --> 00:10:39,620
But why?

106
00:10:41,139 --> 00:10:43,240
It's the last time I'll ever get to dress up.

107
00:10:44,899 --> 00:10:48,460
Once I become King, I'll never be able to wear clothes like this again.

108
00:10:48,795 --> 00:10:50,883
So you decided to wear them one last time.

109
00:10:50,907 --> 00:10:51,788
That's right.

110
00:10:53,540 --> 00:10:55,200
Nanny, were you there?

111
00:10:55,700 --> 00:10:58,986
Yes, I was helping her get dressed.

112
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:00,660
Don't cry.

113
00:11:00,845 --> 00:11:01,933
Come on, smile.

114
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,380
How could I not cry?

115
00:11:04,980 --> 00:11:08,053
Sapphire, this will certainly not be the last time you dress up.

116
00:11:08,545 --> 00:11:12,520
Once you ascend to the throne, you can change those old laws right away.

117
00:11:12,919 --> 00:11:14,140
So that anyone can become King.

118
00:11:14,395 --> 00:11:17,100
Take a new step so a woman can become queen.

119
00:11:17,660 --> 00:11:18,193
That's true.

120
00:11:18,639 --> 00:11:19,960
Mother, that's what I'll do!

121
00:11:20,389 --> 00:11:21,389
I'll definitely do it.

122
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,040
I won't back down!

123
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,600
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

