00:13:10,239 --> 00:13:11,620
♪ Dai kanki ♪
Great joy!

158
00:13:12,071 --> 00:13:15,706
♪ Okyaku ya okyaku no dai kanki ♪
Welcome, guests! Such great joy!

159
00:13:15,766 --> 00:13:17,556
♪ Lu lu lu lu lu lu ♪
-

160
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:21,980
♪ O uma wa pa pa pa pa kuruma mo pon pon pon pon ♪
Horses clip-clopping, carriages chugging along!

161
00:13:22,060 --> 00:13:35,540
♪ Yokoso yokoso ureshi ureshi dai kanki ♪
Welcome, welcome! We're so happy, what great joy!

162
00:13:39,481 --> 00:13:41,413
The Great Jubilee is finally tomorrow.

163
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,738
Preparations at the castle are nearly complete,

164
00:13:43,762 --> 00:13:46,220
 and delegates from around the world are arriving one after another.

165
00:13:52,249 --> 00:13:54,812
Ahead of this major ceremony, Prince Sapphire

166
00:13:54,836 --> 00:13:57,440
is surely resting calmly, awaiting the dawn.

167
00:13:58,099 --> 00:14:01,300
Dear God, please grant me courage and strength.

168
00:14:02,075 --> 00:14:03,240
I'm scared.

169
00:14:03,845 --> 00:14:05,680
I'm so terrified of living a lie.

170
00:14:06,180 --> 00:14:07,180
Dawn is already here.

171
00:14:07,545 --> 00:14:09,353
Dear God, please protect me.

172
00:14:20,150 --> 00:14:22,700
Apothecary Ponko, is that poison ready yet?

173
00:14:22,845 --> 00:14:25,180
Hehehehehe, it's almost done.

174
00:14:25,280 --> 00:14:26,320
Just three more hours.

175
00:14:26,469 --> 00:14:28,040
Hurry up, work faster!

176
00:14:28,145 --> 00:14:29,619
We won't make it in time for the Jubilee!

177
00:14:29,765 --> 00:14:32,800
It'll be ready, it'll be ready! Plenty of time before the ceremony.

178
00:14:33,940 --> 00:14:34,861
How effective is it?

179
00:14:35,289 --> 00:14:39,603
One sip and they'll blab whatever's on their mind. It's plenty potent.

180
00:14:39,627 --> 00:14:42,553
If it isn't ready in time, I'll chop off your head!

181
00:14:43,475 --> 00:14:45,380
I'll wait right here until it's finished.

182
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:47,946
Hurry up and make it.

183
00:14:49,770 --> 00:14:50,315
Move it!

184
00:14:51,300 --> 00:14:52,320
So violent.

185
00:14:54,279 --> 00:14:55,680
I'm thirsty. Got any booze?

186
00:14:56,129 --> 00:14:57,129
On the shelf.

187
00:14:57,275 --> 00:14:58,275
This is it.

188
00:15:03,615 --> 00:15:05,560
Ponko, what kind of booze is this?

189
00:15:06,673 --> 00:15:08,213
You grabbed the wrong one, Mr. Nylon.

190
00:15:08,238 --> 00:15:09,474
That's not booze.

191
00:15:09,499 --> 00:15:10,499
That's a weight-gain potion.

192
00:15:10,999 --> 00:15:11,999
A weight-gain potion?!

193
00:15:13,400 --> 00:15:15,873
Do something! Give me a cure!

194
00:15:16,139 --> 00:15:17,779
There's no quick cure for that.

195
00:15:17,811 --> 00:15:19,606
You'll stay like that until it wears off.

196
00:15:20,060 --> 00:15:22,100
Anything will do! A weight-loss potion!

197
00:15:22,900 --> 00:15:23,900
Here.

198
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:33,660
What is it, Ponko?

199
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:35,200
Don't you worry.

200
00:15:35,395 --> 00:15:37,500
You'll be back to normal by the time the potion is ready.

201
00:15:38,030 --> 00:15:40,560
Until then, why don't you take a nice little nap?

202
00:16:08,949 --> 00:16:13,059
We will now begin Prince Sapphire's grand coronation!

203
00:16:19,569 --> 00:16:21,100
I hope everything goes smoothly...

204
00:16:26,269 --> 00:16:28,640
The grand coronation ceremony is about to begin.

205
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,040
Representatives from around the world, dressed in fine attire,

206
00:16:32,064 --> 00:16:35,060
eagerly await the Prince's arrival with bated breath.

207
00:16:35,305 --> 00:16:39,700
Once Prince Sapphire takes this throne, Silverland will welcome its new king.

208
00:16:39,820 --> 00:16:42,380
Grand Duke Duralumin!

209
00:16:46,609 --> 00:16:48,426
Daddy, I want something to eat.

210
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:51,540
Shh! Be patient, there will be a feast later.

211
00:16:55,029 --> 00:16:56,480
You fool, stop that!

212
00:16:56,520 --> 00:16:57,940
Here, I'll give you some candy.

213
00:17:00,680 --> 00:17:03,273
Presenting the Prince!

214
00:17:06,336 --> 00:17:08,986
<i>Sapphire, I pray the ceremony goes smoothly.</i>

215
00:17:09,444 --> 00:17:11,026
Where on earth is Nylon?

216
00:17:11,299 --> 00:17:12,940
He hasn't shown up at the hall yet.

217
00:17:13,079 --> 00:17:14,440
What is he doing?

218
00:17:15,739 --> 00:17:19,060
Presenting Prince Sapphire and Her Majesty the Queen!

219
00:17:33,114 --> 00:17:36,040
Accompanied by the choir, the Prince finally makes his entrance!

220
00:18:03,536 --> 00:18:06,180
Next, we shall proceed with the crowning ceremony.

221
00:18:11,514 --> 00:18:14,600
Look, it has over a hundred diamonds on it!

222
00:18:15,019 --> 00:18:18,559
You fool, it has at least two hundred!

223
00:19:09,069 --> 00:19:10,706
Your Grace, Nylon has returned.

224
00:19:10,885 --> 00:19:11,885
She's back!

225
00:19:12,090 --> 00:19:12,840
I'll make it!

226
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:14,960
Tell him to hurry up and mix the drug into the wine!

227
00:19:21,389 --> 00:19:25,620
The Grand Duke ordered us to mix the potion into the Queen's wine right away.

228
00:19:25,740 --> 00:19:26,740
Give me the medicine!

229
00:19:26,933 --> 00:19:27,340
What?

230
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:27,900
No!

231
00:19:28,185 --> 00:19:29,185
Why not?!

232
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,880
I'm the one who got the medicine!

233
00:19:31,079 --> 00:19:33,260
I should put it in the Queen's glass myself!

234
00:19:34,145 --> 00:19:35,145
Enough already!

235
00:19:35,244 --> 00:19:36,400
You go rest!

236
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:37,420
I'll do it!

237
00:19:37,640 --> 00:19:38,700
I said <i>I'll</i> do it!

238
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:39,800
Get lost!

239
00:19:40,139 --> 00:19:41,666
Just go take a rest!

240
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:42,920
I won't!

241
00:19:43,129 --> 00:19:46,706
Now then, we shall proceed to the toast.

242
00:19:46,954 --> 00:19:49,320
Everyone, I will now pour the celebratory wine.

243
00:19:49,584 --> 00:19:51,673
Once poured, please do not drink until instructed.

244
00:19:52,019 --> 00:19:55,473
Grand Duke Duralumin, please lead the toast.

245
00:19:57,335 --> 00:19:59,480
Hold on. Is that glass for the Queen?

246
00:19:59,580 --> 00:19:59,980
That's right.

247
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:01,573
Sounds good. Alright.

248
00:20:10,669 --> 00:20:11,880
Now it's as good as ours!

249
00:20:37,179 --> 00:20:41,080
Now, a toast to King Sapphire and Silverland.

250
00:20:41,555 --> 00:20:42,555
Cheers!

251
00:20:43,340 --> 00:20:44,340
Cheers!

252
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:45,460
Cheers!

253
00:20:51,029 --> 00:20:52,380
<i>Grand Duke Duralumin!</i>

254
00:20:52,582 --> 00:20:53,075
<i>Wait!</i>

255
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:54,240
Cheers!

256
00:20:54,241 --> 00:20:55,241
Ah!

257
00:20:59,080 --> 00:21:00,080
Mother!

258
00:21:02,889 --> 00:21:04,860
Someone, take Mother to her room!

259
00:21:06,789 --> 00:21:08,760
It's all right now, it's all right.

260
00:21:08,969 --> 00:21:12,933
I never knew keeping this secret alone would be so painful.

261
00:21:13,080 --> 00:21:13,460
Mother!

262
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:16,360
Now is the time to reveal everything.

263
00:21:19,420 --> 00:21:20,840
What do you mean?

264
00:21:23,079 --> 00:21:27,173
Sapphire... my child Sapphire is actually a girl.

265
00:21:28,340 --> 00:21:29,340
What?

266
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:30,040
Yes.

267
00:21:30,249 --> 00:21:31,800
Sapphire is a girl.

268
00:21:32,054 --> 00:21:35,580
To put her on the throne, they forced her to pose as a boy!

269
00:21:46,494 --> 00:21:48,347
Did you all hear that?!

270
00:21:48,372 --> 00:21:50,005
Everyone, that is a direct confession!

271
00:21:50,029 --> 00:21:54,800
For 13 years, this mother and child lied and deceived the nation!

272
00:21:55,115 --> 00:21:55,900
They're traitors!

273
00:21:55,960 --> 00:21:57,653
Cowards who deceived the people!

274
00:21:57,959 --> 00:22:00,280
U-Um... did I say something wrong?

275
00:22:00,414 --> 00:22:02,360
Mother, it's too late!

276
00:22:02,440 --> 00:22:02,793
What?

277
00:22:03,364 --> 00:22:04,440
That's right, it's too late!

278
00:22:04,504 --> 00:22:06,220
You've confessed to everything!

279
00:22:06,480 --> 00:22:07,133
Guards!

280
00:22:07,239 --> 00:22:09,320
Arrest these traitors!

281
00:22:09,479 --> 00:22:12,613
And seize those three henchmen of theirs, too!

282
00:22:18,499 --> 00:22:19,980
This is punishment for deceiving the people!

283
00:22:20,084 --> 00:22:23,766
Prince Sapphire and the Queen shall be locked in the Coffin Tower for life!

284
00:22:23,924 --> 00:22:25,540
Surely no one objects!

285
00:22:25,625 --> 00:22:26,625
The Coffin Tower?

286
00:22:26,745 --> 00:22:27,745
For life?

287
00:22:28,119 --> 00:22:32,179
As for those three, for aiding traitors, they'll be slaves in the quarry!

288
00:22:32,460 --> 00:22:34,126
Slaves in the quarry?!

289
00:22:34,494 --> 00:22:38,533
And on the new throne, my son Plastic shall sit!

290
00:22:43,620 --> 00:22:47,860
No one objects to King Plastic, I presume!

291
00:22:53,479 --> 00:22:56,259
Drag the criminals away!

292
00:22:56,819 --> 00:22:59,023
Now then, Prince Sapphire—or rather, Princess Sapphire—

293
00:22:59,047 --> 00:23:02,780
and Her Majesty, I am afraid you must step into the prison carriage.

294
00:23:08,473 --> 00:23:10,020
Mother, let's go.

295
00:23:12,879 --> 00:23:14,600
Sapphire, forgive me.

296
00:23:15,664 --> 00:23:18,400
Mother we fell right into Duralumin's trap!

297
00:23:18,814 --> 00:23:20,540
He must've been made to drink poisoned wine.

298
00:23:21,235 --> 00:23:23,120
We won't be seeing each other again.

299
00:23:25,064 --> 00:23:26,419
Farewell, then.

300
00:24:12,309 --> 00:24:14,160
That over there is the Coffin Tower.

301
00:24:14,633 --> 00:24:20,760
I pity you, Princess Sapphire, but once you go in there, you'll never leave until you're nothing but bones.

302
00:24:21,175 --> 00:24:22,175
Prepare yourself!

303
00:24:22,199 --> 00:24:24,199

